otengine/godot/issues/110143#issuecomment-3240486418","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110143","id":3240486418,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7BJeYS","user":{"login":"Koyper","id":33969780,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzOTY5Nzgw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33969780?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper","html_url":"https://github.com/Koyper","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Koyper/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-31T23:22:46Z","updated_at":"2025-08-31T23:22:46Z","body":"I see, and thank you for the fast response. So if one were to remove all the monochrome glyphs from Inter, it would pass through all emojis to the system fallbacks? I can see all the many monochrome glyphs in Inter so this makes perfect sense. Is this a behavior that could be toggled? I suppose if the default were to always fall through to system emoji, toggling the monochromes on would simply be disabling system fallbacks.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3240486418/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3243339807","html_url":"https: